-- pop-music single 2026-11-17: The Onion Swift-Rodrigo box-trap satire goes viral
-- VERIFIED: The Onion piece published 16 Nov 2026 (theonion.com); FB post same day 5,257 likes, 78 comments, haha 3,143 top reaction; no real Swift-Rodrigo collab announced (Netflix Junkie, 29 Mar 2026: McCartney Fonda Theatre photo, no collab announced). Article is framed as SATIRE throughout, never as real news.
